WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.587
Lab 2 uses a licensed test tenant with
fictional people, never production.

2
00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:07.283
Read the blueprint-creation
setting yourself,

3
00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:11.437
since there's no Graph property for it,
set it to No, and record the reading.

4
00:00:11.437 --> 00:00:15.267
Then build one properly governed
agent from Learn's sample:

5
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.878
a sponsor who isn't the owner, a managed
identity credential, a handshake,

6
00:00:19.878 --> 00:00:22.456
an inventory row, and
its approval: in G C C,

7
00:00:22.456 --> 00:00:26.051
the plan adds it by name to
the block policy's exclusions.

8
00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:28.455
Run the check with read permissions only,

9
00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:31.851
compare the policy shape with
one made in the admin center,

10
00:00:31.851 --> 00:00:35.812
apply the plan as a person, and
confirm both policies are report-only.

11
00:00:35.812 --> 00:00:37.750
Then remove it all by hand.
